OL,3,GNEWSAHospital bosses face questions
OL,4,Aover neonatal care
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford hospital bosses have offered a
OL,7,Ffresh apology to families harmed by
OL,8,Ffailings in maternity and neonatal
OL,9,Fcare, in the wake of a national
OL,10,Finquiry.
OL,12,FBradford Teaching Hospitals NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust was one of 12
OL,14,Forganisations included in the review by
OL,15,FBaroness Amos, which found maternity
OL,16,Fservices nationally require "urgent"
OL,17,Freform and are no longer fit to give
OL,18,Fhigh quality care.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
