OL,3,GNEWSAHospital bosses face questions
OL,4,Aover neonatal care
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt found a "clear gap" between how
OL,7,Fstaff at Bradford's maternity services
OL,8,F"intend" to care for women and how
OL,9,Ffamilies actually experience that care.
OL,11,FIn a new report to be presented to
OL,12,Fsenior Bradford councillors it says the
OL,13,Ftrust "sincerely apologises" and that
OL,14,Fthose experiences will "drive our
OL,15,Fongoing improvement".
